# The build context is the repository root, so these exclusions are not cosmetic.
# refs/ is a vendored LangChain4j reference checkout and .claude/worktrees/ holds
# complete additional copies of this repository — without these lines every build
# uploads hundreds of megabytes that no stage consumes.

.git/
.github/
.claude/
refs/
docs/
.specs/

**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

.env
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
